  m_Name: book_ 9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BookDefinition
  book_index: 9
  book_title: 'Part II: The First Line'
  book_color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  book_clue_index: 110
  content: This seems to be part of a mystery series. Maybe I should look for the
    earlier volumes.
  clue_content: "\u201CThe public memory has been down for eleven days,\u201D the
    woman said. \u201CWe found these things in storage. Hundreds of sheets, fastened
    along one edge.\u201D\r\n\u201CBooks?\u201D\r\n\u201CPossibly. Can you help with
    the first one?\u201D\r\nMara fetched a pencil.\r\n\u201C\u2018Call me Ishmael.\u2019
    Is that an instruction?\u201D\r\n\u201CSomeone\u2019s introducing himself.\u201D\r\n\u201CWho?
    And there is a brown mark of moon on the surface.\u201D\r\n\u201CKeep reading.\u201D\r\nThe
    woman read slowly. Outside the exchange, the milk lorry rattled past.\r\n\u201CWhen
    does it reach the information?\u201D she asked.\r\nMara settled into her chair.
    \u201CThere\u2019s no hurry.\u201D"
